{"a":[34,34],"h":"<p><svg class=\"ea\" width=\"136\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 136.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 23.3 47.3 47.3 63.0 69.7 78.7 87.0 87.0 93.7 105.7 105.7 113.3 113.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"28.6 35.3 35.3 69.7 93.7 120.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Haydin selâm ve selâmet ile girin ona -dinecek.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"64\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 64.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 33.0 33.0 40.4 40.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 48.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> İşte o - giriş günü<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"113\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 113.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 24.0 32.3 32.3 39.0 39.0 51.7 51.7 59.3 75.0 75.0 81.7 81.7 90.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"90.0 96.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> hulûd günüdür. - Ya'ni ebedî kalmanın mukadder olduğu gündür ki Kur'anda «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"96\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 95.9 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7 18.0 24.7 24.7 40.4 51.0 57.7 57.7 66.7 66.7 74.2\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"9.7 40.4 81.0 81.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » diye zikrolunup duran hulûd o günden i'tibaren başlıyacaktır. Artık onun nihayeti yoktur. </p>"}